    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Pharmacy Prescriptions Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Pharmacy Prescriptions History API allows clients to access comprehensive records of past prescriptions filled by patients at a pharmacy. This endpoint provides insights into medication dispensed, including details such as medication name, dosage, and filling dates. It is particularly useful for healthcare providers seeking to review a patient's medication history for better clinical decision-making and for pharmacists to ensure medication safety. Typical consumers of this API include pharmacies, hospitals, and healthcare applications that require historical prescription data.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
